Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `value` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/ownership/plain_parameter_write_take_and_escape_diagnostics_name_explicit_access_2.jet:3:34
    |
  3 | relay: fn<T>(value: T) { consume(value) }
    |                                  ^^^^^
 Why: `value` is a read or write parameter, so its caller keeps the value; moving it here would copy it
 Fix: Write `value.copy()` when `consume` should receive a copy, or declare the parameter `value: &&T` so the caller hands the value over
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
